    "note": "FS states 6.4 Tbps for the NC8200-4TD (datasheet Table 5, and the product page prints 3.2 Tbps for the same box). 6.4 Tbps is the duplex aggregate; per direction it is 3.2 Tbps, which is what 4x NC8200-24BC offers as 96x 25G + 8x 100G. Ports are compared to the per-direction figure, so a full 24BC load is exactly line-rate."
